# Legacy beep code notice

The original 2024 beep numbers do not apply to version 2.1.

Read docs/BEEP_CODES.md for current patterns:
- Repeating five short beeps: low suction alarm.
- Repeating three longer beeps: monitor fault (including either pressure sensor).

Wiring: I2C SDA=GP12, SCL=GP13 (not GP20/GP21).
